meta {
  name: messages-app
  seq: 11
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

script:pre-request {
  // Builds the x-user header from the secret `fiscal_code` env var.
  const fiscalCode = bru.getEnvVar("fiscal_code");
  const assertionRef = bru.getEnvVar("assertion_ref");
  if (fiscalCode) {
    const xUser = {
      date_of_birth: "2000-06-02",
      family_name: "Rossi",
      fiscal_code: fiscalCode,
      name: "Mario",
      assertion_ref: assertionRef,
      session_tracking_id: "session-tracking-id",
      spid_level: "https://www.spid.gov.it/SpidL2",
      created_at: Date.now(),
      token_remaining_ttl: 2591990,
    };
    bru.setVar("x-user-value", btoa(JSON.stringify(xUser)));
  }
}

docs {
  # Local message fixtures

  Seeded by `setup-cosmos-containers.js` and `setup-azurite-containers.js`.
  All messages below are PROCESSED with content, except the two REJECTED messages, which have no content.
  RC means Remote Content; READ, UNREAD and UNAVAILABLE refer to the ADVANCED `read_status`.

  For GetMessageForService, set `message_id` and `fixture_fiscal_code` in the request variables.
  Every matrix scenario is available for each recipient: `LVTEST00A00A197X`, `LVTEST00A00A198X`, `LVTEST00A00A199X` and `LVTEST00A00A200X`.
  Existing fixtures use `LVTEST00A00A199X`, except the payment fixture (`LVTEST00A00A200X`).
  Set `sender_subscription_id` to `01JR0QRJ8MX1PD06DE6X5FWXS6` for generic RC, or `01JR0QRJ8MX1PD06DE6X5FWXS5` for SEND and messages without RC.
  For UNAVAILABLE scenarios, use `01JR0QRJ8MX1PD06DE6X5FWXS8` for generic RC or `01JR0QRJ8MX1PD06DE6X5FWXS7` otherwise: these services have read-status access denied for every recipient.
  ADVANCED read/payment fields require both `ApiMessageRead` and `ApiMessageReadAdvanced` groups.

  | Message ID | Recipient fiscal code | Message type |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `01M1FX00000000000000000001` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | STANDARD without payment, without RC |
  | `01M1FX00000000000000000002` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | STANDARD without payment, generic RC |
  | `01M1FX00000000000000000003` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | STANDARD without payment, SEND |
  | `01M1FX00000000000000000004` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | STANDARD with payment, without RC |
  | `01M1FX00000000000000000005` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | STANDARD with payment, generic RC |
  | `01M1FX00000000000000000006` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | STANDARD with payment, SEND |
