  | `01M1FX00000000000000000008` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | ADVANCED without payment, without RC, UNREAD |
  | `01M1FX00000000000000000009` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | ADVANCED without payment, without RC, UNAVAILABLE |
  | `01M1FX00000000000000000010` | `LVTEST00A00A197X` | ADVANCED without payment, generic RC, READ |
